#>texture_verdigris_paint
#:material #!pigment

~verdigris-paint[pigment]{granulation, bloom edges, misregistration}

// the studio's standing look, so the file opens on texture.website as the line it would make
~verdigris-paint[close, overcast, handled, as-found](wall)<tile>

word: "verdigris paint"
science: "Coloured particles carried in a binder or water; how the particles settle as the carrier leaves makes washes, blooms and granulation."
